<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/svar/dict/koch/1> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "स्वर् II /svar/ (P. pr. /svarati/ — I- fut. /svari-ṣyati/- pf. /sasvāra/- aor. /asvd_rīt/, /asvārṣīt/) 1) издавать звуки- звучать 2) воспевать, восхвалять 3) сиять"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
  dct:source "koch" .

<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/svar/dict/koch/2> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "स्वर् III /svar/ n. 1) солнце 2) солнечный свет, блеск 3) небо"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
  dct:source "koch" .

<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/svar/dict/koch/3> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "स्वर् I /svar/ (P. pr. /svarayati/ — X- pf. /svarayāñcakāra/- aor. /asasvarat/) 1) придираться 2) ругать- порицать"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
  dct:source "koch" .

<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/svar/dict/kna/4> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "स्वर्\t/svar/\t\t/свар/\tsvar indecl. священное слово (собств. свѣтъ, небо, солнце). — [см. подъ sūrya].\tс. 284"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
  dct:source "kna" .

<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/svar/dict/fri/5> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "II svar n.; солнце, свет, небесный свод, небо, одна из трех vyāhṛti"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
  dct:source "fri" .

